{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織と一泊2日強羅へ旅に出かけました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人でずっと調べて調べて決めました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"調べながらスキー場もよくない？とか\n色々脱線しながらもなんとか旅館を見つけて\n年上の伊織が予約とかしてくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも強羅って何処なんだろう...って二人で話しながら最終日の帰りに何処なのかやっとわかりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな二人での旅のお話をどうぞ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"箱根では色々食べたり町並みを満喫しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山食べて〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてまた旅館でも食べて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜は洋画を見ながらお菓子パーティー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても話しが難しいお話だったのですが\n伊織が見たことあったらしく途中途中止めて説明してくれました..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてお部屋に露天風呂もついてるんですけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯の時間があるので後で入ろうってなって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもどうしても先に少し入りたくて\n二人で足湯だけしよう！\nってなって二人で入ったのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欲が出てしまい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は足湯だけでけのはずが太ももの上の方まで入ってしまい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意味わからないけど二人で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ニーハイ湯だ！ニーハイ湯〜」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってケラケラ騒いでました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてさっき一部乗せた食事を食べて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人でゆっくりお風呂に入ろうと思ったら\n温泉が湧いてるとこに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「さー水、さー湯」\nって書いてあって\n「これなんだろー？」\nって言ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織\n「これさし水とさし湯だよ！\n昔の字みたいに流れ書きしてあるから〝し〟が伸ばし棒に見えてるだけ！！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと教わりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも夜は持参したトランプで遊んだんですけど、\n七並べ、スピード、ババ抜き、神経衰弱...\n全部負けました..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日はなんだか伊織を初めて年上と感じました..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人で足をバタバタしてお風呂で運動をしたり意味わかんないけどいい女風のポーズをして写真撮ったり...楽しかったね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旅館のフロントでは話せるような雰囲気ではなくとても落ち着いたとこだったので\nフロントでは二人で小声で話して大人ぶりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか１つ大人になった気分だったね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後はかりんちゃんちに行き、\nディズニーみたいなお家を楽しんで、\nみんなでカラオケに行き\nありえないぐらい盛り上がって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご飯を食べに行って...\nとっても充実した二日間でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校がお休みだったので、こんな満喫できたのは久しぶりでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業式は終わりましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私ももうすぐ卒業式です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校卒業か...はやいなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また改めてブログで書かせていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/03/02/3389623/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"}],"source":"archive"}